      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been an issue even since the big 2018 update they pushed. since then RIFT users lag (and can crash) when opening the Avatar/social menu. \nThey randomly lose their sight and have to restart the game. (you can still hear and interact, just cant see anything) \nOr when new avatars load in or play animations it can now also crash you. \nI could be in a room with 30 people no safety on and be perfectly fine, since the update, I can crash easily with 5 people in the room if someone switches models.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
